OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked after       
OL,4,Asending sexualised messages to         
OL,5,Avulnerable woman                       
OL,7,FA misconduct panel found the Police    
OL,8,FService of Northern Ireland (PSNI)     
OL,9,Fofficer and the woman had formed an    
OL,10,Femotional and intimate relationship.   
OL,11,FBoth denied having a physical sexual   
OL,12,Frelationship.                          
